      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kurkú faanqw oo waawuti'iimár Yehu oo Israeli Yoashi waawuti'iima gana iimu/ún baraá yaamaá Yudawo amór Yerusalemu. Inós baraá waawuti'iimaro kureeri ngaa /aáy a mibeeri tsiyáhh. Umuú aayoorós a Sibia ar yaamaá Be'er-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baraá slafiingós sleémeero gan'amu guna tleéhh dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGUHE, asma inós kuna intsaahhatamís nee kaahamusmoó Mungú Yehoyada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tam adoorihe kiteeridaá munguaá hatlá' awa gawaá gongoama' kaa fee/iiká nee muu ina kumiít ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i hanmisuwo nee mooyángw tsuú' kuwa da/aa/an gawaá gongoama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoashi kaahamuusér Mungú sleémeero gana ateét, giri báy, «Peésaadá' tindi huwaahuwi nee muu baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ar adoodá' hee kura peésaarós i gooín, laqaá hee gana tawo slaá' ar muunaáwós peésaarós haniisaro, dír doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kaahamuusér Mungú peésa ngi ilaót dír umuú heewo, nee inooín daqaní wa/aameedá' aa hhiturumit baraá do'o ngi amohhe'eesiye'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala tam alaá kureeri mibeeri tsár nee tám awa waawuti'iimár Yoashiwo, kaahamuusér Mungú gár aa tléhh i káhh gawaá do'odae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe, waawutmo Yoashi kaahamusmo Yehoyada nee kaahamusér hatlae giri yaahaás, «Ahaá baré do' ugwa amohhe'esi'iiká? Gimsé' peésár muu ma kwatitara', huwaare' as do' kuwa amohhe'eesaan.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaahamuusér Mungú adoodá' gari ya/aán, peésár muu ngiri mayé' niri ooiyé', «Atén doó Mungú u tleehhanaaká.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy kaahamusmo Yehoyada sandakmo guri qaás bihhaá doó /iyáy awa kitángw ta ilahhooárí hanmamisi amór bihhadá' muu ir daraahi baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, tuuntukmár sandakmo gari fooxiís. Kaahamuuse tidá' ti baalaqamiim, peésadá' tindi huwahuwi nee muu sleémeero kana qaás baraá sandakmoodá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár barka ár peésa aa tláhh baraá sandakmodae, goousmoó waawutmo nee kaahamusmoó úr oo Mungú tan dah peésaadá' kari faar, nee kari tsegiit baraá warqama', kari baats. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peésaadá' kawa hhe'eés qoomeemesuwo, mukdaádá' gadiyeé ga sagesihhmiít ar doó Mungú, kuri peésaadá' i haniís, inooín mukdá' peehháy gwa hhasliit nee do' gwa tleehh kuri buú', ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kari buu' sleeme ar múk koo/ír tleéhh nee kudá' tlaa/e gaa tsiihh, peehháy kuri tlaáxw nee tlaa/aá ta tsihhi as doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuwa tleehhi, nee muruú hatlá' sla'amuút kway tlaáxw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala peésaarí kaa burumburiiká as iimpedudaá peésa kiwa tleehhi, makaasír támboó mishumaa, nee búklaaywo nee tarumbeéta laqaá xooslár hatlá' ar sahaábu laqaá ar peésa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peésaadá' sleémeero kana buú' ar mukdá' doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ gwaa inki/is tlehhmuuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukdá' gadiyeédá' gaa tleehh an múk ló'wa inkihhimuú koóm, gawaá adoorihe, adór peésaadá' iri gadiyús heé ga faaro leelehhiít i kaahh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peésaadá' taa burumbuúr as ilahhooár dakuús nee tidár tlakweema hingeesa kaa huwiiká baraá doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ, tidá' kana máy dír kaahamuusér Mungú as tawa tooín.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
